    "The verifier depends on the fixed public Arc RPC; it does not implement consensus verification.",
    "Private sources/keys stay off-chain; their availability and separate device control are not proven.",
    "After authorization but before receiving a hash, wallet outcome can be unknown; no automatic retry occurs."
